          "id": "AC-001",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "truth-umbrella",
          "text": "Beacon exposes `beacon-truth` as the preferred v1.5.2+ human-facing truth umbrella for feature package requirement work.",
          "required": true,
          "status": "draft",
          "implemented_by_run_id": null,
          "verified_by_run_id": null,
          "accepted_at": null,
          "changed_in_revision": "R2",
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:docs/beacon/v1.5.2/features/beacon-truth-skill-lifecycle-rename/truth.md"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-002",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "mode-separation",
          "text": "`beacon-truth` must preserve distinct modes for definition, acceptance, coverage, and change instead of flattening all requirement work into one freeform truth surface.",
          "required": true,
          "status": "draft",
          "implemented_by_run_id": null,
          "verified_by_run_id": null,
          "accepted_at": null,
          "changed_in_revision": null,
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:docs/beacon/v1.5.2/features/beacon-truth-skill-lifecycle-rename/truth.md"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-003",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "package-authority",
          "text": "Every `beacon-truth` mode must resolve feature truth through `beacon truth-map resolve <feature> --project . --version v1.5.2 --json` before reading or writing requirement material.",
          "required": true,
          "status": "draft",
          "implemented_by_run_id": null,
          "verified_by_run_id": null,
          "accepted_at": null,
          "changed_in_revision": null,
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:docs/beacon/v1.5.2/features/beacon-truth-skill-lifecycle-rename/truth.md"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-004",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "compatibility-aliases",
          "text": "Existing `beacon-prd`, `beacon-user-story`, and `beacon-test-case` skills remain available as compatibility aliases for `truth.define`, `truth.acceptance`, and `truth.coverage`.",
          "required": true,
          "status": "draft",
          "implemented_by_run_id": null,
          "verified_by_run_id": null,
          "accepted_at": null,
          "changed_in_revision": null,
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:docs/beacon/v1.5.2/features/beacon-truth-skill-lifecycle-rename/truth.md"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-005",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "lifecycle-language",
          "text": "Root Beacon and brainstorm guidance must describe the preferred truth chain as `truth.define -> truth.acceptance -> truth.coverage`, while documenting the old skill names as aliases.",
          "required": true,
          "status": "draft",
          "implemented_by_run_id": null,
          "verified_by_run_id": null,
          "accepted_at": null,
          "changed_in_revision": null,
          "story_id": "",
